{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object seen, move and approach, take it, check properties, do specific task or scan for object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />\"",
